    <briefdescription>
<para>Per-SUnit data computed during DFS for various metrics. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A node&apos;s SubtreeID is set to itself when it is visited to indicate that it is the root of a subtree. Later it is set to its parent to indicate an interior node. Finally, it is set to a representative subtree <ref refid="namespacellvm_1_1_calling_conv_1abdf8cf606905c10634e831390981b0ed" kindref="member">ID</ref> during finalization. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
